 *
 * JSON format: { "replies": [{ "inReplyToId": 123, "threadId": "PRRT_...", "reply": "outputs/review_replies/thread1.md" }] }
 * The "reply" field may be a path to a Markdown file (preferred) or inline text (legacy).
